driver mali
class gpu
match acpi CIXH5000
# The GPU translates through page tables its driver writes, so no SMMU
# confines it whatever the IORT names.
own-mmu
# Its _CCA says 1; CIX's kernel runs it on ACE-Lite with non-cacheable
# mappings because the display controller doesn't snoop
# (docs/boards/orangepi-6-plus/README.md; AbyssBSD's gpu.md).
coherence noncoherent CIX runs it on ACE-Lite, uncached (AbyssBSD gpu.md)
# devmgr powers the GPU up before the driver starts, in its graph's order:
# SCMI domain 21 (_DSD), the clocks below (CLKT), the power resource's _ON,
# then gpu_reset (RSTL, RST0 9) pulsed. The GPU needs a pulse: asserted
# and let go, not only released (what the driver did before devmgr did).
power-up graph
power-clocks gpu_clk_core gpu_clk_stacks
reset-pulse 20
